Maintainer: Edward Honour <ed@maludb.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), gnupg
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/maludb/maluos
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: maluos-keyring
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: GnuPG archive key of the MaluOS package repository
 The MaluOS repository digitally signs its Release files. This package
 contains the archive key used for that, installed where APT's
 Signed-By option expects it (/usr/share/keyrings).
